# ir_alias_registry.pith — the compiler's record of names that stand
# for other names: type aliases, module aliases, import renames, and
# what each import declares (functions, globals, and — after the
# imported-kind fix — the globals' type kinds). filled while imports
# resolve, consulted by every call and type lookup after.

